The program works around invalid certificates of Google Code's Mercurial hosting:  when a clone's
default path, from .hg/hgrc, is an hg.codespot.com URL or a googlecode.com URL with two components
before "googlecode.com" (which a "*.googlecode.com" wildcard certificate does not cover), "hg
outgoing" is run with "--config web.cacerts=".  Only .hg/hgrc is consulted, not the configuration
file.
